        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>B站个人空间: Herry013</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>基于虚幻五引擎开发</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>详细介绍：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >少年方太平因一场意外，穿越回大燕建安年间。这个世界此时正处于灵气复苏之际，灵气的弥漫带来了更多的生机与希望，但同时也涌现了各种诡谲危险。在此间存活，努力求生，回到现世，是其最终目标。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游戏内容：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5张精美写实的古风地图</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种天气变化：晴，雨，雾，尘，雪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4种武器类型及相应动作模组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+武学心法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+各具特色的敌人 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+武功招式卡牌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各色NPC和各种店铺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种主线支线任务穿插</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游戏场景：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/1c31c8dda31fb77be35aa31a1a103e10.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/6c446532aba3563749d9dd7dd2652746.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/49876424ba0fa31cc93c959b9351b161.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/2d97c6ad7c871d186535fdbd95207094.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/003699c3dd579bdee1b572f0b08ae6c1.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/16e6ff893fbb245620db59904e33f977.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>B站个人空间: Herry013</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>基于虚幻五引擎开发</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>详细介绍：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >少年方太平因一场意外，穿越回大燕建安年间。这个世界此时正处于灵气复苏之际，灵气的弥漫带来了更多的生机与希望，但同时也涌现了各种诡谲危险。在此间存活，努力求生，回到现世，是其最终目标。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游戏内容：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5张精美写实的古风地图</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种天气变化：晴，雨，雾，尘，雪</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4种武器类型及相应动作模组</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+武学心法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+各具特色的敌人 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+武功招式卡牌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各色NPC和各种店铺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >多种主线支线任务穿插</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>游戏场景：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/1c31c8dda31fb77be35aa31a1a103e10.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/6c446532aba3563749d9dd7dd2652746.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/49876424ba0fa31cc93c959b9351b161.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/2d97c6ad7c871d186535fdbd95207094.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/003699c3dd579bdee1b572f0b08ae6c1.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205840/extras/16e6ff893fbb245620db59904e33f977.avif?t=1755248340\" width=600 height=400 /></span></p>",
        "short_description": "《荡天下》 是一款融合国风武侠与策略卡牌的3D角色扮演游戏。战斗方式以roguelike卡牌招式为核心，融合了角色养成模式和回合制战略模式。你将踏入一个灵气复苏、诡秘横行的江湖，在充满未知的冒险中揭开祸乱之谜。通过动态卡组构筑与回合制策略，在随机生成的江湖中不断突破自我，直至问鼎武道之巅！",
        "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
